docs {
Koleksi event/acara (46-api-events.md).
Publik: GET /api/v1/events (list published), GET /api/v1/events/:slug.
Admin: CRUD /api/v1/admin/events (root/admin/reviewer).
Usulan: POST /api/v1/event-contributions (boleh anonim, 5/jam per IP),
moderasi /api/v1/admin/event-contributions (approve/reject/request-revision).

source_url disimpan BERSIH di DB (tanpa UTM). UTM
utm_source=sambasku.com disisip saat render (rule external-link-utm).

occurrence_status = upcoming | ongoing | completed | cancelled, diturunkan
read-time dari starts_at/ends_at/cancelled_at - tidak disimpan.
}
